    <p class="prose-body mt-3"><span class="prose-body">Ghost has the ability to broadcast articles into the fediverse
      and pull replies back. That's a great start. But Jacobin wanted to go further: a structured community
      space with groups, topics, polls, and specialised moderation and governance tools. Each tool does what it does best: Ghost
